  "title": "Grandma Oma&#39;s Pickled Okra",
  "description": "Pickled okra is easy to make with this grandma-tested recipe and will turn your ho-hum cheese boards and relish trays into something special.",
  "authors": [
    "Lorelei Rusco"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:29:24-04:00",
